---
import { sitePath } from "../lib/catalog";
---
<aside class="recognition-band">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Your contribution deserves recognition</p>
    <h2>Share a sample. Earn your badge.</h2>
    <p>The Script Samples contributor badge is for every sample contributor, including first-time contributors. After your first accepted sample, opt in to the community recognition program. Badges are issued in batches, not instantly.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="https://pnp.github.io/recognitionprogram/">Get your contributor badge <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
  </div>
  <a href="https://pnp.github.io/recognitionprogram/" aria-label="Learn how to earn the Script Samples contributor badge">
    <img class="recognition-badge" src={sitePath("assets/credly-badge.png")} alt="Microsoft 365 and Power Platform Community Script Samples contributor badge" width="170" height="170" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </a>
</aside>
